      "trigger": "A fork push-only continuation captures expected remote tip S; the fork advances to T and its tracking ref is refreshed before the preflight scan. Approve the resulting push preview.",
      "impact": "The scanner retains only force=true for a nondeletion --force-with-lease argument, obtains base=T from the tracking ref, and generates a new lease for T. APPROVED replaces the literal push before guard::prepare_push, so the captured lease S is not enforced and the old continuation can overwrite newer fork commits.",
      "recommendation": "Carry the fork expected OID into the reviewed plan, refuse a different advertised/tracked tip, and retain worker push evidence for bind_leases. Do not relax the preflight or fork guards.",
      "qualification": "Static source trace. The full rebase-and-push entry is separately blocked by G2; this applies to the push-only continuation and must be preserved when integrating that entry."
    },
