      "trigger": "Confirm Rebase #N onto <base> and push for an otherwise valid fork plan.",
      "impact": "run_ops_ex sends the combined plan to scan, which rejects its -c rebase.updateRefs=false rebase step as neither a NUL expectation nor a supported companion branch operation. The worker and new fork rebase guards are never reached; the user receives Complete this local operation first, then preview its push separately.",
